# SEO / UI / A11y (when applicable — Skip if not touched)

**SEO/AEO/GEO** (frontend/public only): Semantic HTML, lazy-load, non-blocking; JSON-LD + answer-first. API/CLI/workers/admin/`mobile` → Skip.
**UI/Responsive** (UI only): No hardcoded `px` (unless unavoidable). If ecosystem (Tailwind/Fluent) exists, use it. Else `rem`/`em`/`%`/`vw`/`vh`/flex/grid. Do not remove breakpoint classes (`md:`/`lg:`) without reason. **Exception (this repo classic → SPFx clone):** visual SoT = `DBS-FFW-classicsite/2025/style.css` — do not change classic `px` / hex / Gap / letter spacing / line height / hover / animation / `@media` widths (1200, 1024, 959, 768, 640, 480, etc.). No Fluent-only 480/1024 heuristic (`classic-visual-parity`).
**A11y** (UI/interactive only): One `h1` per view. **Exception (classic clone):** preserve classic heading structure — do not add new `h1` that breaks layout. Controls = keyboard + visible focus + name (`label`/`aria-label`). Meaningful `alt`; decorative `alt=""`/`aria-hidden`. Do not rely on color alone. Motion → `prefers-reduced-motion` (reduce classic animation only under reduced-motion — do not remove by default).
